# Story page: nm-endless
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Crumbling
---
The tunnel narrowed like a throat, and the floor crumbled away behind every move.

Keep going, or be swallowed. {name} kept going. {name} always keeps going, which is both its finest quality and the root of nearly all its trouble.

And at the far end, for the first time, {name} saw the shape ahead clearly. It was a tail. It was its own.
